<b>Special Thanks to This Episode's
 Local Heroes!</b>

00:23:13.490 --> 00:23:14.780
<b><i>Tea Hero Sajin</i></b>

00:23:13.490 --> 00:23:17.750
<b>Did you spot them?</b>

00:23:13.490 --> 00:23:17.750
<b>Tea Hero Sajin 888
(Nonaka Kobo, Inc)</b>

00:23:17.750 --> 00:23:19.120
<b>These heroes are 
not a work of fiction!
They really exist!</b>

00:23:27.010 --> 00:23:28.260
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:27.940 --> 00:23:29.670
Next time on episode 11...

00:23:28.260 --> 00:23:32.000
<b>The Sacrifice Willingly Attending
the Banquet of Evil Gods Must
Either Be Eaten and Accept Their
Role as Sacrifice or Devour the
Evil Gods and So Become One</b>

00:23:29.670 --> 00:23:30.730
See you then!
